    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL SEND SOLO OR CO-OP WITH 1-4 PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your squad or run it solo to full send through a world and all the threats within.\u00a0Master fast, fluid movement and advanced shooting to destroy robots, gather resources, and complete objectives to level up and upgrade your Fullsender to be ready for whatever happens next...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODERN FUTURISTIC WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullsenders carry a primary weapon, a sidearm and a melee weapon and there are lots of each to discover, collect and master all with original recoil patterns and sprays and designs, find your loadout and customise it to your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLEAN, PRECISE, UNRESTRICTED MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullsenders are known for there movement, they can carry momentum using slides, jumps, air strafes, wall bounces, b-hopping and much more... Movement is key to survival but a top Fullsender can become untouchable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK PERMENANT UPGRADES AND COSMETICS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to get stronger is to lock in as you use your skill to level up, gain upgrades and shape your Fullsender... You can also upgrade your drip too, you might start with a paper bag and a wooden spoon but that's not where it ends.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL SEND SOLO OR CO-OP WITH 1-4 PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your squad or run it solo to full send through a world and all the threats within.\u00a0Master fast, fluid movement and advanced shooting to destroy robots, gather resources, and complete objectives to level up and upgrade your Fullsender to be ready for whatever happens next...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MODERN FUTURISTIC WEAPONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullsenders carry a primary weapon, a sidearm and a melee weapon and there are lots of each to discover, collect and master all with original recoil patterns and sprays and designs, find your loadout and customise it to your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLEAN, PRECISE, UNRESTRICTED MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fullsenders are known for there movement, they can carry momentum using slides, jumps, air strafes, wall bounces, b-hopping and much more... Movement is key to survival but a top Fullsender can become untouchable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK PERMENANT UPGRADES AND COSMETICS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to get stronger is to lock in as you use your skill to level up, gain upgrades and shape your Fullsender... You can also upgrade your drip too, you might start with a paper bag and a wooden spoon but that's not where it ends.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fullsenders is a 1-4 player co-op movement shooter based in an AI-overrun world... Master fast, fluid movement and advanced shooting to destroy take back the world. Gather resources, complete objectives and extract to level up and upgrade your Fullsender... Just do it before night time comes.",
